- 전용 unittest: 21/21 통과
- frozen evidence exact byte/SHA: 12/12 통과
- actual source `.uasset` byte/SHA guard: 통과
- source-free editor payload: 통과
- fresh-only/no overwrite/no duplicate/no rename: 통과
- native `BPTYPE_Interface`/`CLASS_Interface` validator: 통과
- exact two-graph/one-entry/ordered-pin validator: 통과
- `Velocity` extra-pin rejection: 통과
- source GUID reuse rejection: 통과
- compile/save zero-error/zero-warning/clean gate: 통과
- report exclusive reservation/atomic finalize: 통과
- mutation timeout `mutation_state_unknown/do_not_retry`: 통과
- offline dry-run connection/mutation 0: 통과

